  "description": "SQL orchestration layer for Dapper — compile-time SQL injection prevention, fluent multi-command transactions, auto-parameterization, retry, and multi-result-set mapping. Database-agnostic core; add a dialect package (PureLogicTek.DapperPipeline.SqlServer, PureLogicTek.DapperPipeline.Sqlite, or PureLogicTek.DapperPipeline.PostgreSql) for your database.",
